{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "intro",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Container & settings — v0.1\n\nFull deletion/relink lifecycle: pass 5.\nCurrent memory refresh: pass 4.\nBasic agent/chat deletion already exists.\n\n[[Container & Settings Rules]]",
      "x": 0,
      "y": -450,
      "width": 980,
      "height": 300,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "delete",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Delete project / section / agent\n\nDelete its actual Granite-owned folder tree and all descendant database chats.\nGeneral cannot be deleted individually.",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 440,
      "height": 320,
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "settle",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Stop and settle first\n\nCancel descendant queues/approvals.\nStop active work; keep completed edits.\nRetain genuine unresolved outcome records.\nThen delete the physical container/data.",
      "x": 540,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 440,
      "height": 320,
      "color": "2"
    },
    {
      "id": "physical",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Physical contents are deleted\n\nInternal repository code inside the deleted tree is removed too.\nRemove owned summaries/index state.\nOther surviving chats are not rewritten.",
      "x": 1080,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 440,
      "height": 320,
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "external",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## External link targets survive\n\nRemove attachment metadata, not the linked folder.\nExisting completed external code remains.\nAnother link to deleted internal code becomes unavailable.",
      "x": 1620,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 440,
      "height": 320,
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "missing",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Linked folder unavailable\n\nShow a warning: folder cannot be found.\nOffer Relink folder.\nNo silent empty replacement.\nChat can still answer without the files.",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 500,
      "width": 440,
      "height": 320,
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "relink",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## User chooses a folder\n\nSame repo at a new path, or different codebase.\nOne current attachment; no detach to chat-only.\nSettle active work before retargeting.",
      "x": 540,
      "y": 500,
      "width": 440,
      "height": 320,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "reorient",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Refresh before editing\n\nOld operation records stay with old resources.\nInvalidate repository caches/indexes.\nNotify model; inspect current files.\nKeep chat history; no old-action replay.",
      "x": 1080,
      "y": 500,
      "width": 440,
      "height": 320,
      "color": "2"
    },
    {
      "id": "duplicate",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Duplicate links allowed\n\nStore links and warn about independent edits.\nSerialize runs within each project.\nNo global unique-owner lock.\nAdvanced coordination comes later.",
      "x": 1620,
      "y": 500,
      "width": 440,
      "height": 320,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "memory",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Edit memory / notes\n\nManual and agent edits have equal standing.\nCurrent eligible contents are saved truth.\nDo not favor an old cached copy.\nHistorical chats remain separate.",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 1000,
      "width": 440,
      "height": 320,
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "refresh",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Next model request\n\nRefresh eligible file versions.\nKeep scope and context bounds.\nUse current notes when retrieving.\nNo cancellation to inject edits.",
      "x": 540,
      "y": 1000,
      "width": 440,
      "height": 320,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "settings",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## User changes permission\n\nDo not automatically Stop generation or an executing action.\nUser can Stop if immediate interruption is wanted.",
      "x": 1080,
      "y": 1000,
      "width": 440,
      "height": 320,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "authorize",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Next request / tool action\n\nRefresh context and tool definitions.\nCheck each tool against current permission before execution.\nOld schemas cannot authorize a new denied action.",
      "x": 1620,
      "y": 1000,
      "width": 440,
      "height": 320,
      "color": "2"
    },
    {
      "id": "model",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Fixed session model\n\nModel/provider stays fixed for this chat/model session.\nDifferent model → separate session.\nCross-provider session migration deferred.",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 1500,
      "width": 440,
      "height": 320,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "skills",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Requested skill import\n\nInstall existing package under agent/tools/skills/.\nKeep SKILL.md + resources.\nNo redundant install confirmation.\nImport does not run scripts or enable MCP.",
      "x": 540,
      "y": 1500,
      "width": 440,
      "height": 320,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "lookup",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Optional discovery — pass 5\n\nCompact direct core.\nScoped lookup for integrations.\nPortable function-tool implementation.\nRanking/caching tuning: v0.3.",
      "x": 1080,
      "y": 1500,
      "width": 440,
      "height": 320,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "handoff",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Delivery status\n\nPasses 1–3/3A implemented.\nNext: context → lifecycle/extensions → integrated verification.\n\n[[Harness Implementation Plan]]",
      "x": 1620,
      "y": 1500,
      "width": 440,
      "height": 320,
      "color": "3"
    }
  ],
  "edges": [
